Expose the number of Granite frame contexts on a pyrowave device.
With the default two, a decode blocks the submitting CPU thread whenever
the GPU has not finished the decode submitted two frames earlier, so a
brief GPU hiccup stalls the caller instead of queueing work.
This changes no bitstream or shader arithmetic.

